prompt_template:
Start offboarding for Employee {{ doc.name }} ({{ doc.employee_name }}).

HR clicked "Start Offboarding" on the Exit tab and the relieving date is already saved on the
Employee record, so nothing downstream is blocked on it.

Employee: {{ doc.name }}
Company: {{ doc.company }}
Relieving date: {{ doc.relieving_date }}
Resignation letter date: {{ doc.resignation_letter_date or "not set" }}
Date of joining: {{ doc.date_of_joining }}
Status: {{ doc.status }}
Today: {{ now.date() }}

Work through steps 1-7 in order.

Draft the interview feedback for Interview {{ doc.name }} from its transcript.

Interview: {{ doc.name }}
Interview Type: {{ doc.interview_type }}
Candidate: {{ doc.custom_applicant_name or doc.job_applicant }} (Job Applicant {{ doc.job_applicant }})
Designation: {{ doc.designation }}
Held on: {{ doc.scheduled_on }} {{ doc.from_time }} to {{ doc.to_time }}
Current status: {{ doc.status }}
Transcript filed by: {{ doc.custom_transcript_source or "unknown" }}{% if doc.custom_transcript_received_on %} on {{ doc.custom_transcript_received_on }}{% endif %}

Start with interview_feedback_context, read the transcript to the end, then record the assessment in one call.
